# Fix CI Test Command

The CI workflow is failing because `turbo` does not recognize the `--run` argument passed via `npm test -- --run`. In turbo, pass-through arguments must be preceded by an additional `--`.

## Proposed Changes

### CI Workflow

#### [MODIFY] [ci.yml](file:///c:/Users/dgper/Proyectos/ZeroCode/.github/workflows/ci.yml)

Change `npm test -- --run` to `npm test -- -- --run` to ensure `turbo` correctly passes the `--run` flag to the underlying test runner.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Verify that `turbo run test -- --run` is the intended command structure for passing arguments to sub-tasks in a turbo monorepo.
